context (layout registers, flags) lives in the base, so a layer may call procedures that need
every other managed stack empty (Proposition 14).

* `RecRep_unique`: the record representation determines the integers, so the output of a layer
  does not depend on the base (used for loops).
* `encK_encK`: a managed frame inside the base can be moved into the managed part.
